/build-demo

# Paraglide (§12.2) — compiled from project.inlang/ + messages/*.json, which
# ARE committed; this directory is generated by `pnpm run paraglide:compile`
# (wired into `prepare`/`check`) and the Vite plugin.
/src/lib/paraglide
# Paraglide 3's compile cache (project.inlang/cache/paraglide-js), written by
# the Vite plugin at build time — not only in inlang's own
# project.inlang/.gitignore, which a fresh checkout never has (Paraglide 2's
# project loader wrote it; 3 does not), because the release workflow's
# goreleaser step refuses a dirty tree (.woodpecker/release.yaml).
/project.inlang/cache/

